    "desc": "Canadian melodic house Guru GAR presents \"Feels Like\", a thrilling vocal melodic house release inspired by the emotional journeys we all experience throughout life. Blending heartfelt vocals, lush melodic progressions, warm grooves, and immersive atmospheric textures, the track captures the excitement, uncertainty, nostalgia, and hope that shape our most meaningful moments.\n\nInspired by the ever-changing nature of human emotion, \"Feels Like\" explores the feeling of being caught between where you have been and where you are going. Its evolving melodies and expressive vocal layers create a journey that moves seamlessly between introspection and exhilaration, reflecting the highs and lows that make every experience uniquely personal.\n\nWith its cinematic soundscape, infectious melodic energy, and emotionally resonant vocal character, \"Feels Like\" showcases GAR's signature storytelling through electronic music. Crafted for sunset drives, summer evenings, melodic dancefloors, and moments of reflection, the track is a celebration of feeling deeply, embracing the journey, and simply letting the music take you there.",
